# line up. `i18n:catalog:check` proves these files are FRESH by recompiling the
# .po and comparing bytes, so the compiler has to be their only author. Prettier
# unquotes object keys that do not need quotes ("Approvals" -> Approvals), which
# is a change the compiler would not make and would therefore read as staleness
# on every run — a permanently red gate that no edit could fix.
